    {
      "id": "W7222982165",
      "doi": "10.1364/oe.619020",
      "title": "Photonic-aided wideband mm-wave transmission with scalable subband-selective reception based on AGFB-OFDM",
      "authors": [
        "Gang Li",
        "Yuxiao Xu",
        "Jianping Zhu",
        "Huan Chang",
        "Zhipei Li",
        "Dong Guo",
        "Sitong Zhou",
        "Xiaolong Pan",
        "Xiangjun Xin"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Optics Express",
      "venue_abbr": "OE",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "orthogonal frequency division multiplexing"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/oe.619020",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/7d53ff81-2089-4146-b7ec-6e5238e4f13e.html",
      "summary": "该研究提出基于自适应广义滤波器组OFDM的光子辅助宽带毫米波传输架构，通过结构化子带和选择性提取匹配接收端处理需求。仿真考察8、10和12个子带，在给定OSNR下获得与传统全带接收相当或更低的平均BER。实验将含10个子带的6 GHz信号经10 km标准单模光纤和26 GHz载频的1.5 m无线链路传输，实现22.5 Gbit/s总速率、93.75%频谱利用率及3.75 bit/s/Hz频谱效率。在光电探测器输入功率为−6 dBm时，全部子带BER低于HD-FEC门限。单个所选子带采用512点FFT处理，全带处理则需5120点FFT；实验还展示了不同子带采用16QAM/QPSK的异构传输。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
